{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddca <strong>Adventure Awaits at the Edge of the World</strong><br>Welcome to <strong>Tundra</strong>, a playful open-world adventure across the icy frontiers of Earth.<br>Explore, climb, and swim while living as \u2014 and alongside \u2014 the wildlife that calls these frozen lands home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From emperor penguins diving through cracks in the ice to Arctic foxes darting through snowdrifts and mythic deer wandering beneath the northern lights \u2014 every corner of the tundra is alive. Whether you\u2019re exploring as an animal yourself or helping them through small tasks, every moment is calm, cozy \u2014 and full of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108910/extras/83d02c7290f9eaaa3f999cc8fe851cc1.avif?t=1761790389\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 <strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Animals</strong> \u2013 Waddle across ice as a penguin, explore snowy forests as an Arctic fox, roam the tundra as a mythical deer, or follow polar bears and seals across the frozen shorelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Frozen Worlds</strong> \u2013 Journey through the <strong>Antarctic</strong>, with its penguin colonies, icy cliffs, and shimmering undersea life \u2014 or explore the <strong>Arctic</strong>, filled with snowy forests, open tundra, and aurora-lit nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swim Beneath the Ice</strong> \u2013 Dive through cracks in the frozen sea, follow penguins underwater, and uncover glowing sea life and secret caverns below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb and Explore</strong> \u2013 Scale frozen cliffs, leap across icy ledges, and reach cozy lookout points hidden among the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Adventures</strong> \u2013 Play as or help the local wildlife: guide penguins to their chicks, bring food to foxes, or simply explore together across the frozen frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill but Full of Life</strong> \u2013 No rush, no enemies \u2014 just a vibrant, ever-changing frozen world to explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108910/extras/ca98704fa66d6310c781580d34aabdb3.avif?t=1761790389\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108910/extras/46711424391e090d4f776440e45a8f00.avif?t=1761790389\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf28\ufe0f <strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim with penguins, wander through Arctic forests, watch deer glow beneath the aurora, or climb glaciers to hidden overlooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want calm exploration, playful animal adventures, or to simply enjoy the world\u2019s quiet beauty, <strong>Tundra</strong> is a cozy escape into the wild \u2014 part sandbox, part nature sim, and all adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108910/extras/98589f4bb94e9b7f75db6eeb13381657.avif?t=1761790389\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2744\ufe0f\u00a0<i>Playful penguins. Peaceful vibes. Endless discovery.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108910/extras/8acc0ccc2b8d9752e0bcfd4db1aedf44.avif?t=1761790389\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108910?t=1761790389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108910/28168227d305a04c3a7dc11fd11395ef801d4a47/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761790389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108910/0f55be0774ed67fcb95940f10fa7467647f9a636/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761790389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108910/0f55be0774ed67fcb95940f10fa7467647f9a636/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761790389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddca <strong>Adventure Awaits at the Edge of the World</strong><br>Welcome to <strong>Tundra</strong>, a playful open-world adventure across the icy frontiers of Earth.<br>Explore, climb, and swim while living as \u2014 and alongside \u2014 the wildlife that calls these frozen lands home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph